================================================================================
 THIRD-PARTY ASSETS (bundled into ./slime-depths/assets/)
================================================================================

This game uses art, audio, and UI assets from third-party packs. Each
pack is licensed by its original author under its own terms (CC BY,
CC0, or commercial-use asset-store licenses, as applicable). Below is
the attribution list; refer to each pack's own LICENSE / README for
authoritative terms.

 * Tiny RPG Character Asset Pack v1.03b (20 Characters)
   — Character sprites (knight, slime, skeleton, orc, archer, priest,
     wizard, vanguard, lancer, etc.) in ./slime-depths/assets/characters/
     and ./slime-depths/assets/enemies/.

 * Kenney Roguelike Dungeon tileset (kenney.nl)
   — Dungeon tiles in ./slime-depths/assets/tiles/.
   — CC0 / public domain per Kenney's standard terms.

 * Pixel Fantasy 30 Tracks Music Pack
   — Background music in ./slime-depths/assets/music/ (ambient, boss,
     crypt, vault, abyss, inferno).

 * Free Raven Fantasy Icons
   — Relic / fusion icons in ./slime-depths/assets/icons/.

 * Other Worlds Slime pack
   — Bundled for future use; not currently rendered at prototype scale.

If you believe an asset is incorrectly attributed or licensed, please
contact the copyright holder listed at the top of this file so we can
correct it.
